@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 인증 성공 횟수
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/aerotrace.auth.api_key.attempts
    ?tag=outcome:success
    &tag=reason:none
Accept: application/json

### 인증 헤더 누락 횟수
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/aerotrace.auth.api_key.attempts
    ?tag=outcome:failure
    &tag=reason:missing_credentials
Accept: application/json

### 잘못된 Key 형식 횟수
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/aerotrace.auth.api_key.attempts
    ?tag=outcome:failure
    &tag=reason:malformed_key
Accept: application/json

### 존재하지 않는 Key 횟수
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/aerotrace.auth.api_key.attempts
    ?tag=outcome:failure
    &tag=reason:unknown_key
Accept: application/json

### Key 조회 성공 지연시간
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/aerotrace.auth.api_key.lookup.duration
    ?tag=result:found
Accept: application/json

### Key 조회 실패 지연시간
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/aerotrace.auth.api_key.lookup.duration
    ?tag=result:not_found
Accept: application/json

###
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json